</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">暗暝<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">암`미ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    riet-loan-sí’e thḭ̄-khi chīn-chiṵ-kīn-yā’e àm-mí\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">小雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇼ˆ허ˉ</rt></ruby> 앟 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>에<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">記<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">기</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siô-hōr ah lì kâm-kôh-e-ki\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">提起<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">테키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">初戀<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">처ˉ롼ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">寫批<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">샤ˆ풰ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute