tion: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">좐버-</rt></ruby><span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">시ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">今夜<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">긴ˉ야ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헝ˉ허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">創治<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">청`디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-nai-jê joan-por-sī, kīn-yā hōng-hōr lêh-chòng-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">小雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇼ˆ허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">引<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">인ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꾼<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">슐ˉ</rt></ruby>’키릐\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siô-hōr în-gùn siṵ̄’khi-li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">思念<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">意義<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이`끼ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">就<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쥬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">分離<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">훈ˉ리ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">開始<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">캐ˉ시`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kâm-kông-sū-liām’e ì-gī, jiu-si-hūn-lī’e khāi-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">害<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">해-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">害<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">해-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;po