\">\n    tan-goan-li-piêt si-jiam-sí, m-si-wi-hām’e khāi-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">小雨<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">쇼ˆ허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">請<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">챨ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉達<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">좐ˆ닫ˆ</rt></ruby>’이\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siô-hōr chiâ̰-lì joân-tât’i\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">思念<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">意義<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이`끼ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">就<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">쥬-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relat